    defEn: 'First read: a translucent larval creature with cold-blue glowing sacs suspended inside and glass-like gill leaves opening and closing. Styling entry: transparent membrane, lantern abdomen, long tail filaments, and wet abyssal pressure texture. Biological evidence: cracked gill leaves, pulsing internal light, salt-rimed edges, and soft-body contraction marks. Behavioral pressure: it appears fragile but lures prey with light. Boundary: avoid turning it into a generic glowing jellyfish or cute pet.',
